    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presenting an opportunity to acquire a residential site extending to approximately 0.6 of an acre in the scenic and highly accessible townland of Ballykeoghan, Kilmacow. Offered for sale subject to planning permission, this regularly shaped parcel of land provides a wonderful blank canvas for a purchaser looking to design and build a bespoke family home tailored to their exact lifestyle requirements.\r\n\r\nThe site boasts an attractive, mature setting with excellent road frontage along the R448, seamlessly blending the tranquillity of the County Kilkenny countryside with outstanding connectivity. It offers the rare advantage of a peaceful rural lifestyle without compromising on modern convenience.\r\n\r\nLocation is truly second to none. The site is situated just 8 kilometres from the vibrant city of Waterford, offering easy access to exceptional employment hubs, schools, and amenities. For those commuting further afield, the M9 motorway and the charming village of Mullinavat are a mere 6 kilometres away, bringing Dublin and the wider region within comfortable reach, while the historic medieval city of Kilkenny is just a 40-kilometre drive. This is an exceptional prospect for a discerning buyer seeking space, privacy, and a strategic location to create their forever home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "➡️ Generous Plot Size: Approximately 0.6 of an acre, offering ample space for a substantial dwelling, driveway, and landscaped gardens.\r\n\r\n➡️ Planning Security: Offered for sale strictly subject to the purchaser securing planning permission.\r\n\r\n➡️ Excellent Frontage: A well-proportioned, regular-shaped site benefiting from substantial and accessible road frontage.\r\n\r\n➡️ Scenic Surroundings: Set in an attractive, mature rural landscape in the highly sought-after Kilmacow area.\r\n\r\n➡️ Superb Connectivity: Located directly on the R448, just 6km from Mullinavat village and the M9 Dublin motorway network.\r\n\r\n➡️ City Proximity: A highly convenient 8km commute to Waterford City and 40km to Kilkenny City."
      }
